msgctxt "72N7d0"
msgid "In a pasture, grass is eaten by grasshoppers, grasshoppers by frogs and frogs by snakes."
msgstr "En un pastizal, los saltamontes comen pasto, las ranas comen saltamontes y las serpientes comen ranas."

