msgctxt "AcKlQI"
msgid "Explain it more simply"
msgstr "Explícalo de forma más sencilla"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "BQcZJ-"
msgid "Because it's not about how much they eat. Every animal spends almost all the energy from its food just staying alive. Breathing releases that energy as heat. Only about 10% passes to the next level."
msgstr "Porque no se trata de cuánto comen. Cada animal gasta casi toda la energía de su comida solo para mantenerse con vida. Al respirar, libera esa energía en forma de calor. Solo alrededor del 10% pasa al siguiente nivel."

